OL,3,GNEWSASeafront repair works under way
OL,4,Aafter storm damage
OL,5,
OL,6,FWorks to reinforce a seafront have
OL,7,Fstarted after it was battered by winter
OL,8,Fstorms.
OL,10,FIn May, the Environment Agency (EA)
OL,11,Fannounced it had approved #19.8 million
OL,12,Ffor the multi-million pound scheme at
OL,13,FTorcross in Devon.
OL,15,FThe defences were damaged by multiple
OL,16,Fstorms in January, eventually leading
OL,17,Fto part of the A379 coastal road
OL,18,Fbetween Torcross and Slapton being
OL,19,Fwashed away in February - the road
OL,20,Fremains closed.
OL,23,APub: 08-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
